---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="What is FBLA? | Irvington FBLA" description="Future Business Leaders of America (FBLA) is the largest business career and technical student organization in the world. Learn about its mission and benefits.">
	<section class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>What is FBLA?</h1>
			<p>Future Business Leaders of America</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="text-content">
				<h2>About FBLA</h2>
				<p>Future Business Leaders of America (FBLA) is the largest business Career and Technical Student Organization (CTSO) in the world. Each year, FBLA helps over 230,000 members prepare for careers in business.</p>
				
				<h2>Our Mission</h2>
				<p>FBLA inspires and prepares students to become community-minded business leaders in a global society through relevant career preparation and leadership experiences.</p>

				<h2>Why Join FBLA?</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Leadership Development:</strong> Develop essential soft skills like communication, teamwork, and problem-solving.</li>
					<li><strong>Academic Competitions:</strong> Compete in over 70 events ranging from Accounting to Web Design at regional, state, and national levels.</li>
					<li><strong>Community Service:</strong> Participate in projects that give back to the community and foster civic responsibility.</li>
					<li><strong>Networking:</strong> Connect with business professionals, alumni, and other ambitious students from across the country.</li>
					<li><strong>Scholarships & Awards:</strong> Access exclusive scholarships and recognition programs for members.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>The Irvington Chapter</h2>
				<p>At Irvington High School, our FBLA chapter is one of the most active student organizations on campus. We provide our members with opportunities to travel, compete, and grow as leaders. Whether you are interested in finance, marketing, technology, or entrepreneurship, there is a place for you in Irvington FBLA.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0052cc 0%, #003366 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.page-header p {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: white;
		opacity: 1;
	}

	.content-section {
		padding: 4rem 0;
	}

	.text-content {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	h2 {
		color: #003366;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 2rem;
	}

	p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		color: #4b5563;
	}

	ul {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		color: #4b5563;
	}
	
	strong {
		color: #1f2937;
	}
</style>